{"seq":2,"slug":"grading-direction","title":"调色方向与风格定义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-science/color-grading-theory/grading-direction","wordCount":1555,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"调色方向与风格定义\">调色方向与风格定义</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>调色方向（Grading Direction）是在动手操作之前回答的战略性问题：<strong>这组画面要传达什么情绪？</strong> 它是色彩心理学的落地层——从抽象的&quot;我要暖调&quot;到具体的&quot;阴影偏向 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>220</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">220°</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">220°</span></span></span></span></span> 蓝紫、中间调保持 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>35</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">35°</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">35°</span></span></span></span></span> 暖橙、高光去饱和&quot;。风格定义则是将方向固化为可复用的参数集——LUT、预设或节点树。本文建立从方向选择到风格实现的完整框架。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;Grading Direction&lt;br/&gt;调色方向&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Narrative Intent&lt;br/&gt;叙事意图&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;Technical Framework&lt;br/&gt;技术框架&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;Style Codification&lt;br/&gt;风格固化&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;Mood Board&lt;br/&gt;情绪板&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[&quot;Color Script&lt;br/&gt;色彩脚本&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;Tonal Split&lt;br/&gt;色调分离&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[&quot;Saturation Map&lt;br/&gt;饱和度分布&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[&quot;Contrast Structure&lt;br/&gt;对比度结构&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[&quot;LUT&lt;br/&gt;查找表&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[&quot;Preset&lt;br/&gt;预设&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[&quot;Node Tree&lt;br/&gt;节点树&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"Grading Direction&lt;br/&gt;调色方向\"] --&gt; B[\"Narrative Intent&lt;br/&gt;叙事意图\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"Technical Framework&lt;br/&gt;技术框架\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"Style Codification&lt;br/&gt;风格固化\"]\n    B --&gt; B1[\"Mood Board&lt;br/&gt;情绪板\"]\n    B --&gt; B2[\"Color Script&lt;br/&gt;色彩脚本\"]\n    C --&gt; C1[\"Tonal Split&lt;br/&gt;色调分离\"]\n    C --&gt; C2[\"Saturation Map&lt;br/&gt;饱和度分布\"]\n    C --&gt; C3[\"Contrast Structure&lt;br/&gt;对比度结构\"]\n    D --&gt; D1[\"LUT&lt;br/&gt;查找表\"]\n    D --&gt; D2[\"Preset&lt;br/&gt;预设\"]\n    D --&gt; D3[\"Node Tree&lt;br/&gt;节点树\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>调色方向是&quot;动手之前&quot;的战略层决策，其核心可以概括为：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>方向先于操作</strong>：它回答&quot;这组画面要传达什么情绪&quot;，决定了后续所有技术操作的方向和边界。</li>\n<li><strong>风格可定位在二维坐标</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Style Position</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>warm-cool</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>contrast</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Style Position} = (W_{\\text{warm-cool}}, C_{\\text{contrast}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Style Position</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">warm-cool</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">contrast</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，暖冷轴与对比轴构成的四象限可快速锚定风格。</li>\n<li><strong>色调分离是核心技法</strong>：按明度区间为阴影/中间调/高光分配不同色相，是&quot;有色彩倾向&quot;而非&quot;整体偏色&quot;的关键。</li>\n<li><strong>风格需要固化才可复用</strong>：LUT、预设、节点树把一组调色决策打包成可重复应用、可跨镜头统一的格式。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"方向选择的决策框架\">方向选择的决策框架</h2><h3 id=\"决策维度\">决策维度</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>选项光谱</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>温度</td>\n<td>极冷 ← → 极暖</td>\n<td>蓝调夜景 vs 金色日落</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>饱和</td>\n<td>去饱和 ← → 高饱和</td>\n<td>纪实真实 vs 商业鲜艳</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对比</td>\n<td>低对比（雾面） ← → 高对比（硬朗）</td>\n<td>柔和人像 vs 戏剧光影</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>明度</td>\n<td>低调（暗） ← → 高调（亮）</td>\n<td>电影感 vs 轻盈感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>色相丰富度</td>\n<td>单色/双色 ← → 全色域</td>\n<td>风格化 vs 自然</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"四象限快速定位\">四象限快速定位</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Style Position</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>warm-cool</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>contrast</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Style Position} = (W_{\\text{warm-cool}}, C_{\\text{contrast}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Style Position</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">warm-cool</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">contrast</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"quadrantChart\" data-source=\"quadrantChart&#10;    title 调色风格四象限&#10;    x-axis &quot;冷调&quot; --&gt; &quot;暖调&quot;&#10;    y-axis &quot;低对比&quot; --&gt; &quot;高对比&quot;&#10;    quadrant-1 &quot;电影大片&quot;&#10;    quadrant-2 &quot;黑色电影/科幻&quot;&#10;    quadrant-3 &quot;北欧极简/文艺&quot;&#10;    quadrant-4 &quot;复古/胶片&quot;\">quadrantChart\n    title 调色风格四象限\n    x-axis \"冷调\" --&gt; \"暖调\"\n    y-axis \"低对比\" --&gt; \"高对比\"\n    quadrant-1 \"电影大片\"\n    quadrant-2 \"黑色电影/科幻\"\n    quadrant-3 \"北欧极简/文艺\"\n    quadrant-4 \"复古/胶片\"</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>象限</th>\n<th>温度+对比</th>\n<th>代表风格</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>暖+高对比</td>\n<td>好莱坞大片、史诗</td>\n<td>《角斗士》、《1917》</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冷+高对比</td>\n<td>黑色电影、科幻</td>\n<td>《银翼杀手》、《社交网络》</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冷+低对比</td>\n<td>北欧文艺、纪录片</td>\n<td>《杀人回忆》、北欧犯罪剧</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>暖+低对比</td>\n<td>复古胶片、生活</td>\n<td>《小妇人》、Wes Anderson</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"色调分离-tonal-split\">色调分离（Tonal Split）</h2><h3 id=\"原理\">原理</h3><p>色调分离是调色最核心的技术——将画面按明度区间分配不同色相：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Color</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><msub><mi>H</mi><mtext>shadow</mtext></msub></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>low</mtext></msub></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><msub><mi>H</mi><mtext>mid</mtext></msub></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>low</mtext></msub><mo>≤</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>high</mtext></msub></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><msub><mi>H</mi><mtext>highlight</mtext></msub></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>high</mtext></msub></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Color}(L) = \\begin{cases} H_{\\text{shadow}} &amp; L &lt; L_{\\text{low}} \\\\ H_{\\text{mid}} &amp; L_{\\text{low}} \\leq L \\leq L_{\\text{high}} \\\\ H_{\\text{highlight}} &amp; L &gt; L_{\\text{high}} \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Color</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.32em;vertical-align:-1.91em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.35em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎩</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.192em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎨</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.292em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.6em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎧</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.85em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.41em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">shadow</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">mid</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">highlight</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.41em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">low</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" s