t\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">280°</span></span></span></span></span>)</td>\n<td>奇幻、不安</td>\n<td>恐怖/奇幻</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Warm Mono</td>\n<td>暖棕 (<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">25°</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25°</span></span></span></span></span>)</td>\n<td>暖黄 (<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50°</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50°</span></span></span></span></span>)</td>\n<td>统一暖调</td>\n<td>怀旧/复古</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cool Mono</td>\n<td>深蓝 (<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>230</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">230°</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">230°</span></span></span></span></span>)</td>\n<td>浅蓝 (<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>200</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">200°</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200°</span></span></span></span></span>)</td>\n<td>统一冷调</td>\n<td>科技/冬季</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"三区域-vs-五区域\">三区域 vs 五区域</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>区域划分</th>\n<th>精细度</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>2 区（阴影/高光）</td>\n<td>基础</td>\n<td>快速风格化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3 区（阴影/中间/高光）</td>\n<td>标准</td>\n<td>大多数调色</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5 区（极暗/阴影/中间/高光/极亮）</td>\n<td>高级</td>\n<td>精细电影调色</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"饱和度策略\">饱和度策略</h2><h3 id=\"全局饱和度方向\">全局饱和度方向</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方向</th>\n<th>值范围</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>去饱和</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-30\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">30%</span></span></span></span></span> ~ <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-60\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">60%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>纪实、沉重、真实</td>\n<td>战争/纪录片</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>微降</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-10\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">10%</span></span></span></span></span> ~ <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-20\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">20%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>柔和、自然</td>\n<td>人像/生活</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>原始</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>无调整</td>\n<td>基准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>微增</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+10\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">10%</span></span></span></span></span> ~ <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+20\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">20%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>鲜明、活力</td>\n<td>旅行/风景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高饱和</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+30\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">30%</span></span></span></span></span> ~ <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+50\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">50%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>超现实、冲击</td>\n<td>广告/时尚</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"选择性饱和度\">选择性饱和度</h3><p>真正的风格化调色不是&quot;全部加/减&quot;，而是<strong>对不同色相区域差异化处理</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>做法</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>肤色保护</td>\n<td>仅保留橙/红饱和度</td>\n<td>人物突出、环境淡化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单色强调</td>\n<td>去除所有色彩仅保留一种</td>\n<td>极端风格化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>互补饱和</td>\n<td>互补色各加饱和，其余降</td>\n<td>强烈对比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>暗部去饱和</td>\n<td>仅降低暗区饱和度</td>\n<td>电影质感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>亮部去饱和</td>\n<td>降低高光饱和度</td>\n<td>过曝胶片感</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"对比度结构\">对比度结构</h2><h3 id=\"s-曲线的语义\">S 曲线的语义</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Contrast</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>output</mtext></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>input</mtext></msub></mrow></mfrac><msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"2.4em\" maxsize=\"2.4em\">∣</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>mid</mtext></msub></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Contrast} = \\frac{dL_{\\text{output}}}{dL_{\\text{input}}} \\bigg|_{L_{\\text{mid}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Contrast</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5556em;vertical-align:-1.1056em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">input</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">output</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:2.4em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"2.4em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 2400\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v1200 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v-1200 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v1200 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:-0.5214em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.7003em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">mid</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1056em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>中间调斜率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> = 高对比，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> = 低对比。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>曲线形状</th>\n<th>对比度</th>\n<th>情绪</th>\n<th>技法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>强 S</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>戏剧性、有力</td>\n<td>拉大中间调斜率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>弱 S</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>自然、平衡</td>\n<td>轻微 S</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线性</td>\n<td>原始</td>\n<td>平淡/RAW起点</td>\n<td>不调曲线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反 S</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>柔和、雾面</td>\n<td>压缩中间调</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>提黑</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>复古、胶片</td>\n<td>曲线左端抬起</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>压白</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>淡雅、日系</td>\n<td>曲线右端压下</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"风格固化工具\">风格固化工具</h2><h3 id=\"lut-look-up-table\">LUT（Look-Up Table）</h3><p>LUT 是将输入 RGB 映射为输出 RGB 的数学表——它将完整的调色决策打包为一个文件：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>LUT 类型</th>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>精度</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1D LUT</td>\n<td>每通道独立曲线</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>Gamma/曝光/简单色调</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3D LUT (17³)</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>17</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>17</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>17</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">17 \\times 17 \\times 17</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">17</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">17</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">17</span></span></span></span></span> 立方</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>快速预览</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3D LUT (33³)</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>33</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>33</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>33</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">33 \\times 33 \\times 33</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">33</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">33</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">33</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>标准调色</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3D LUT (65³)</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>65</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>65</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>65</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">65 \\times 65 \\times 65</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">65</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">65</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">65</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>精密影视</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"lut-工作流注意事项\">LUT 工作流注意事项</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;Source Space&lt;br/&gt;源色彩空间&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;LUT Input&lt;br/&gt;LUT设计输入空间&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;LUT Transform&lt;br/&gt;LUT 变换&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;LUT Output&lt;br/&gt;LUT输出空间&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;Display&lt;br/&gt;显示/输出&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"Source Space&lt;br/&gt;源色彩空间\"] --&gt; B[\"LUT Input&lt;br/&gt;LUT设计输入空间\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"LUT Transform&lt;br/&gt;LUT 变换\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"LUT Output&lt;br/&gt;LUT输出空间\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"Display&lt;br/&gt;显示/输出\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>注意事项</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>输入空间必须匹配</td>\n<td>LUT 为 Rec.709 设计则输入必须是 Rec.709</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不可逆</td>\n<td>LUT 应用后信息丢失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>强度控制</td>\n<td>通常以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mtext>–</mtext><mn>80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50\\%–80\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50%–80%</span></span></span></span></span> 强度应用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>肤色检查</td>\n<td>通用LUT可能不适合所有肤色</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"实战-从参考到风格\">实战：从参考到风格</h2><h3 id=\"风格提取流程\">风格提取流程</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1. 收集参考</td>\n<td>从电影/摄影作品提取帧</td>\n<td>截图/Moodboard</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2. 分析参数</td>\n<td>测量色温、对比、饱和度</td>\n<td>示波器/直方图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3. 识别色调分离</td>\n<td>观察暗部/亮部色相偏向</td>\n<td>矢量示波器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4. 复刻基础</td>\n<td>设定全局参数</td>\n<td>RAW处理器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5. 精细匹配</td>\n<td>HSL/曲线/蒙版微调</td>\n<td>逐色调整</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6. 固化</td>\n<td>导出为 LUT/预设</td>\n<td>工具内导出</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>调色方向的选择是创意工作的<strong>最高层决策</strong>——它决定了后续所有技术操作的方向和边界。好的方向选择让技术操作有的放矢，糟糕的方向选择则让再精细的技术也无法拯救画面。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>决策层级</th>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>产出</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>叙事层</td>\n<td>要传达什么故事/情绪？</td>\n<td>情绪板/色彩脚本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>方向层</td>\n<td>暖/冷？高/低对比？饱和？</td>\n<td>四象限定位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>技术层</td>\n<td>具体分区色相？曲线形状？</td>\n<td>参数设定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>固化层</td>\n<td>如何复用？如何统一？</td>\n<td>LUT/预设/节点树</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"调色方向与风格定义","id":"调色方向与风格定义"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"方向选择的决策框架","id":"方向选择的决策框架"},{"level":3,"text":"决策维度","id":"决策维度"},{"level":3,"text":"四象限快速定位","id":"四象限快速定位"},{"level":2,"text":"色调分离（Tonal Split）","id":"色调分离-tonal-split"},{"level":3,"text":"原理","id":"原理"},{"level":3,"text":"经典色调分离方案","id":"经典色调分离方案"},{"level":3,"text":"三区域 vs 五区域","id":"三区域-vs-五区域"},{"level":2,"text":"饱和度策略","id":"饱和度策略"},{"level":3,"text":"全局饱和度方向","id":"全局饱和度方向"},{"level":3,"text":"选择性饱和度","id":"选择性饱和度"},{"level":2,"text":"对比度结构","id":"对比度结构"},{"level":3,"text":"S 曲线的语义","id":"s-曲线的语义"},{"level":2,"text":"风格固化工具","id":"风格固化工具"},{"level":3,"text":"LUT（Look-Up Table）","id":"lut-look-up-table"},{"level":3,"text":"LUT 工作流注意事项","id":"lut-工作流注意事项"},{"level":2,"text":"实战：从参考到风格","id":"实战-从参考到风格"},{"level":3,"text":"风格提取流程","id":"风格提取流程"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"}],"prev":{"title":"色彩心理学与情感表达","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-science/color-grading-theory/color-psychology"},"next":{"title":"风格化处理与视觉一致性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-science/color-grading-theory/stylization-consistency"}}